# Canonical host is tradedeckapp.com — 301 everything else so link equity
# consolidates on one hostname instead of splitting three ways.
https://calm-cupcake-a213bb.netlify.app/*   https://tradedeckapp.com/:splat   301!
http://calm-cupcake-a213bb.netlify.app/*    https://tradedeckapp.com/:splat   301!
https://www.tradedeckapp.com/*              https://tradedeckapp.com/:splat   301!
http://www.tradedeckapp.com/*               https://tradedeckapp.com/:splat   301!

